{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/d47ffe203dc2fb5e3005b9b13a68c290.poster.avif?t=1758434004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/d47ffe203dc2fb5e3005b9b13a68c290.webm?t=1758434004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events take place in the 2000s. After the collapse of the USSR, all structures ceased to function, and people were unable to unite into smaller states and got stuck in banditry and looting. Those who still managed to survive organized small armed groups and established their own orders, norms and morals. In addition, another misfortune came to the world - a shortage of various resources around the world, because of which the territory of the former union, rich in all kinds of benefits, began to attract people from all over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arm yourself to your taste</strong> \u2013 Choose from a variety of weapons from both NATO and Warsaw Pact arsenals. Equip body armor, helmets, and backpacks to customize your loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic PvE and PvP action</strong> \u2013 Play against other players in PvP or challenge yourself in PvE encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI opponents and bosses</strong> \u2013 Encounter AI-controlled enemies, including occasional bosses, providing tactical challenges and variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied matches</strong> \u2013 Each game session can feature randomized elements, including loot, AI behavior, and environmental conditions, ensuring every run feels fresh and challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and trade loot</strong> \u2013 Explore locations to gather items, earn in-game currency, and purchase gear from the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock and equip clothing and cosmetic options as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced gameplay, no aggressive monetization</strong> \u2013 Every player has a fair chance; no pay-to-win gear or battle passes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/night cycle and weather</strong> \u2013 Dynamic conditions influence gameplay, requiring tactical adaptation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice chat</strong> \u2013 Communicate with nearby players, allies, or enemies for coordination or deception. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/a68b1bedd8c02aeb76918b59fc3fd08d.poster.avif?t=1758434004\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/a68b1bedd8c02aeb76918b59fc3fd08d.webm?t=1758434004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/extras/a68b1bedd8c02aeb76918b59fc3fd08d.mp4?t=1758434004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Master: AK-74","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/abdfc09b17be06fb4bc412d1e71b2074df8da743.jpg"},{"name":"Fortunate Event","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/e933d72fccdd664ef7741ebeef9007d489d5292d.jpg"},{"name":"Mercenary: AK-74","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/7a59d2208005fcc1f7f1b9c20f8e95d81aac91e9.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran: AK-74","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/bb404de42a21cb67d52bf9f0f1c6d00eb5d33316.jpg"},{"name":"Pentester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/48230e92bd53ae8183a97971c6bdca1e9579ebde.jpg"},{"name":"Boom Goes the Barrel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/0a44f9bcdc12cde966fef37c3466b48866500080.jpg"},{"name":"Where am I?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/75405edeb4e715c8908b9414fba824ef23cea41d.jpg"},{"name":"On the Edge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/c1963649c773136f2bd548c3537e8c0aaad8a240.jpg"},{"name":"Filthy Rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/5a2b0c698a91152fa148f4978b7712f6b4eb2eee.jpg"},{"name":"Peak Performance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1929230/dd48877da1c90aaf491fc6508e48af13d0697e74.jpg"}],"total":66},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1929230?t=1758434004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758434004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758434004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1929230/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758434004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game 